vFM Player - Tape recordings

SD folder: /vFM/recordings

No download is required. Tape Recorder saves new captures in the system subfolder after STOP or MOTOR OFF. Recording settings are selected in the Tape Recorder menu.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/recordings

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
